{"uid":"6ca8776aa27a1137","name":"test_iteration_history_collapse_and_persistence_together_task042","fullName":"tests.test_browser_hub#test_iteration_history_collapse_and_persistence_together_task042","historyId":"974526398f42d466911c9116b9c00ea2","time":{"start":1791920763718,"stop":1791920779925,"duration":16207},"description":"Task 042 (PRD I.4): one browser-tier test covers I.2 and I.3\n    TOGETHER, in the exact sequence the PRD names: \"collapse, reload,\n    still collapsed; expand, navigate to another run, still expanded\".\n\n    Both runs used here sit AT the I.2 threshold (15 iterations, task 040's\n    own default is collapsed) -- so \"still expanded\" on the second run at\n    the end can only be the persisted I.3 preference winning over I.2's own\n    default, never a coincidence of that run's own iteration count. That is\n    what makes this test cover I.2 and I.3 \"together\" rather than each in\n    isolation the way test_iteration_history_collapse_state_persists_in_\n    localstorage_task041 (I.3 alone, both its runs below the threshold) and\n    test_iteration_history_collapsed_by_default_above_threshold_task040\n    (I.2 alone, no localStorage involved) already do.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 042 (PRD I.4): one browser-tier test covers I.2 and I.3<br />\nTOGETHER, in the exact sequence the PRD names: &quot;collapse, reload,<br />\nstill collapsed; expand, navigate to another run, still expanded&quot;.</p>\n<pre><code>Both runs used here sit AT the I.2 threshold (15 iterations, task 040's\nown default is collapsed) -- so &quot;still expanded&quot; on the second run at\nthe end can only be the persisted I.3 preference winning over I.2's own\ndefault, never a coincidence of that run's own iteration count. That is\nwhat makes this test cover I.2 and I.3 &quot;together&quot; rather than each in\nisolation the way test_iteration_history_collapse_state_persists_in_\nlocalstorage_task041 (I.3 alone, both its runs below the threshold) and\ntest_iteration_history_collapsed_by_default_above_threshold_task040\n(I.2 alone, no localStorage involved) already do.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791920014248,"stop":1791920014248,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791920014248,"stop":1791920014248,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791920763715,"stop":1791920763715,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791920763715,"stop":1791920763716,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791920763716,"stop":1791920763716,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791920763716,"stop":1791920763716,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escalation_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791920763716,"stop":1791920763716,"duration"